<title>EGYPT: Egypt o/night, one week pound rates widen.</title>
<headline>Egypt o/night, one week pound rates widen.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound widened to between 9 1/4 and 10 3/8 percent in a liquid market on Thursday from 10 and 10 1/8 percent on Wednesday, bankers said.</p>
<p>They quoted one week rates of 9 1/2 to 10 1/2 percent compared with 10 1/4 and 10 1/8 percent.</p>
<p>State-owned banks maintained their minimum overnight lending rate at 10 1/2 percent.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
